    "desc_en": "I can't code. I can't draw. So eight AI (Claude) sessions are making my Roblox game, Halo & Horns: a boss who checks everything, two who write the code, two who draw the art (Adobe Firefly), one who puts it in the game, one who makes the sound effects, and one who made this video. I'm the director. In the game, every choice makes you an angel or a devil. Which one are you? Halloween beta: October 31! Not sponsored. AI voice narration. Sound effects: our own, Adobe Firefly and Kenney (kenney.nl, CC0).",
